{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3606340/extras/7c20b4ba99280add905a17bf15eb7462.avif?t=1769512417\" width=548 height=160 /></span></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Procedural, hack and slash, scythe spinning, bullet-hell, hoard reaping waves of action.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Crush sprites by slashing with dual whipping directional WASD controls simultaneously with the Arrow Keys.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Open ended play areas that encourage staying in close proximity to health nodes.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Pleasant feedback based satisfaction.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Spend souls to unlock various ability/upgrade nodes.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Ability nodes unlock via random chance.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Seven Playable Reaper Types.\u00a0 Each unique with their own differentiated scythes and movement stats.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Hand drawn, pen &amp; paper aesthetics merged with digital/pixel graphics. </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >human made sound design and trippy original sound track.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >No story. All videogame.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >*Hand drawn aspects originated on real pen and paper and still exist as real pen and paper drawings.<br><br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3606340/extras/bf2953f0fa526e4edef958f392656ea4.avif?t=1769512417\" width=548 height=160 /></span></p></li></ul>","achievements":{"highlighted":[{"name":"Over Powered","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3606340/aba277d5a44928da424143c49d65db550b15a65c.jpg"},{"name":"Soul Devour","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/publ